Prism brand assets
==================

The launcher icons, wordmark, and TV banner use a purple, faceted play mark
on a charcoal icon field. They do not incorporate the Silo logo or wordmark.
SVG sources are in branding/; scripts/generate-prism-branding.py renders the
Android copies.

